[thin] Functional glyph strokes and diagonal joins of the compact port legend. The narrow sections belong to the letter outlines, including the closing points of A and R, rather than a wall or a leftover cut intersection. The shared font and relief retain the accepted TAP/FLAVOR appearance process.
alternatives: Three-millimetre strokes close the counters at this text size; preserving those counters enlarges the word beyond the 32 mm tile. Engraved or flush text changes the selected raised two-colour legend.
